        <mxCell id="target-legend" value="Green: implemented now   Blue: proposed target tables   Orange: optional/sensitive profile data&#xa;ER arrows show parent → child (1:N). Proposal discussions and private ballots are deliberately absent. The activity feed is a projection, not a separate source-of-truth table." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="target-root">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="990" width="1250" height="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="profile-warning" value="Contact email, country, birthday (month/day), and member-entered skills are optional prototype fields. Keep unset until purpose/visibility/retention are approved. Email is not used for login." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#ea580c;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="target-root">
          <mxGeometry x="1310" y="990" width="760" height="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="postgres-target-notes" value="PostgreSQL conventions: integer identity IDs + integer FKs; timestamptz values stored in UTC; SHA-256 hex digests for session/sensor tokens; archive entities with history instead of deleting. PostgreSQL-specific: numeric amounts · jsonb payloads · partial unique index for current vote · GiST exclusion constraint (btree_gist) for active booking overlap.&#xa;Decision log format is frozen v1: canonical UTF-8 JSON with sorted keys/no whitespace → SHA-256 → Ed25519 signature over the raw digest bytes." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="target-root">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1080" width="2040" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
